{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35167","headline":"诗品二十四则 旷达 · 司空图","name":"诗品二十四则 旷达","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"生者百岁，相去几何。\n欢乐苦短，忧愁实多。\n何如尊酒，日往烟萝。\n花覆茆檐，疎雨相过。\n倒酒既尽，杖藜行过。\n孰不有古，南山峨峨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空图","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35167.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35167","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}